<title>UK: HP Bulmer H1 profits, sales rise.</title>
<headline>HP Bulmer H1 profits, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 25</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		20.21		  vs 16.44</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.90		   vs 4.55</p>
<p> Pretax		     16.6		   vs 13.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   162.6		  vs 136.6</p>
<p> Operating Result	 18.8		    vs 17.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Cider maker HP Bulmer Holdings Plc said that despite a competitive environment it expects to make &quot;satisfactory progress both at home and overseas.&quot; --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
